cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this knowledge base, please cite it as below. For the syllabus itself, cite the ISTQB® CTFL Syllabus v4.0.1."
title: "istqb-ai-ready: ISTQB CTFL syllabus structured for AI agents and QA engineering"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "istqb-ai-ready contributors"
    alias: DEVJS2005
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-07
repository-code: "https://github.com/DEVJS2005/istqb-ai-ready"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A QA engineering knowledge base built on the ISTQB Certified Tester Foundation Level (CTFL)
  Syllabus v4.0.1, structured for AI agents (Claude Code, llms.txt). It provides one file per
  syllabus section with YAML frontmatter, learning objectives with K-levels, glossary terms,
  test design technique guides, a test planning checklist and a test plan template.
keywords:
  - ISTQB
  - CTFL
  - software testing
  - QA engineering
  - quality assurance
  - test design techniques
  - test planning
  - testing best practices
  - llms.txt
  - AI agents
references:
  - type: standard
    title: "ISTQB Certified Tester Foundation Level Syllabus v4.0.1"
    authors:
      - name: "International Software Testing Qualifications Board (ISTQB)"
    year: 2024
    url: "https://istqb.org/certifications/certified-tester-foundation-level-ctfl-v4-0/"
